# Quality Gates

Use skill `finish-task` before claiming completion.

- Run only the verification declared by the plan or project config.
- Do not assume `npm test`, `npm run build`, or `npm run lint` exist.
- Never mark DONE if a required check failed.
- Review the diff, unexpected files, out-of-scope changes, and new TODOs.
- Confirm every required stage is complete.
